{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018tEuPMhWYBtKq1WhqPyJco","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the research context carefully to define three tiers for the Dream simulation.\n\nKey facts from the data:\n\n1. **Paper pivot (D038)**: From \"calibration method\" to \"detection + benchmark-dependent characterization\"\n2. **Core evidence so far**:\n   - IRT γ significant under oracle conditions: GSM8K γ=+3.77 (significant), ARC γ=-0.62/-1.46 (significant)\n   - Negative gamma is real: small model ARC catastrophic forgetting 17pp\n   - Model complexity: 4PL best for MCQ, 2PL best for open-ended\n   - Embedding similarity is the only reliable signal at 0.5B scale with strong AUC, while other confidence methods collapse entirely\n   - IRT calibration consistently underperforms the raw baseline, and coverage drops dramatically across all test conditions\n   - MMLU fitting failed to converge properly, suggesting benchmark-specific challenges\n\nThe 8K model's gamma parameter isn't statistically significant even with real signals, so I need to see if larger models can recover the effectiveness of S2 and S4, whether RRF improves over embedding-only approaches, and whether IRT with actual data shows meaningful calibration gains on multiple benchmarks—all before the EMNLP deadline in 12 days with several experiments still running.\n\nIn the best scenario, multi-scale signals work at 1.5B/3B, RRF adds value, real-signal IRT shows significant gamma on at least two benchmarks, MAE stays competitive, coverage improves with more models, and the sim sweep validates my identifiability bounds. The median path has S1 as the only reliable signal, RRF collapsing back to S1-dominance, gamma significance only under oracle conditions or on specific benchmarks, and a pivot toward detection and characterization framing with identifiability as the theoretical core. In the worst case, S1 itself degrades at scale, no signal produces significant gamma, coverage never improves, and I'm forced to completely reframe the work away from calibration claims.\n\nNow I'm defining the concrete metrics I need to track: gamma significance rate across conditions, MAE improvement over baseline, 95% coverage rates, signal AUC at different scales, ranking preservation via Kendall tau, and the gap between RRF and S1-only performance. Looking at the actual empirical results, the oracle GSM8K case shows gamma at 3.77 with MAE of 0.092 versus raw MAE of 0.005—IRT is substantially worse there. The ARC oracle with 2PL gives gamma around -0.618 with MAE of 0.076, and I need to examine the coverage metric more closely.\n\nDigging into the specific results across different configurations, I'm seeing a mixed picture: S1-only ARC actually performs better than raw (0.035 versus 0.059 MAE), which is promising, though the 62.5% coverage against a 95% nominal target is still problematic. GSM8K with S1 shows a non-significant gamma of 0.187 with convergence issues, while RRF on ARC hits gamma of -2.35 with the same 0.035 MAE, but RRF completely fails on MMLU with rhat diagnostics indicating non-convergence. This suggests the methods have highly benchmark-dependent behavior, so I need to reconsider how to tier these results given the inconsistent performance patterns. - Coverage stays 20-33%\n- All signals fail or only S1 works poorly\n- Reframe: \"negative results paper on calibration + empirical signal characterization\"\n\nNow I'm thinking through how to structure this as a YAML configuration to capture the different outcome scenarios.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27385,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27385},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da9980c1-fa70-4c9b-bf09-5c9f4ae1a081","uuid":"6f34ce6d-bd52-4c49-a292-52357570b660"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018tEuPMhWYBtKq1WhqPyJco","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"Multi-scale 信号恢复 + IRT 校准在部分 benchmark 有效——原始 calibration framing 部分成立，可与 characterization 并行推进\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"S2(Min-K++) 或 S4(Self-Critique) 在 1.5B/3B 恢复到 AUC≥0.65，RRF 聚合优于 S1-only\"\n      - \"γ 在 ≥2 个 benchmark 上用真实信号（非 oracle）显著（CI 排除 0）\"\n      - \"N≥16 multi-seed pooling 后 95% coverage 恢复到 ≥65%\"\n      - \"MMLU IRT 拟合收敛（rhat<1.05, ESS>400）\"\n      - \"exp-004 sim sweep 验证 AUC≥0.70 实用可辨识边界\"\n    number_ranges:\n      gamma_significance_rate: [0.50, 0.75]  # 至少半数 benchmark×scale 条件显著\n      mae_vs_raw_delta: [-0.02, 0.01]  # 部分 benchmark IRT 优于 raw（负=更好）\n      coverage_95: [0.65, 0.85]\n      s2_s4_auc_at_1p5B: [0.65, 0.80]\n      rrf_vs_s1only_mae_gap: [-0.015, -0.005]  # RRF 优于 S1-only\n      kendall_tau: [0.75, 0.90]\n      ppp_range: [0.15, 0.85]  # 后验预测检查在合理区间\n    narrative_direction: >\n      ContamCal 是首个桥接 detection→calibration 的框架，在 MCQ benchmark（ARC/MMLU）上\n      实现统计显著的污染效应校准。保留 Claim 1（calibration）但限定为 \"benchmark-dependent\n      calibration\"——对 inflation 和 forgetting 双向校准。Claim 2 升级为 \"multi-scale\n      signal effectiveness\"。Fisher Info 可辨识分析（Claim 3）提供理论支撑。论文同时推\n      characterization（γ_k 异质性、Min-K++ 反转）和 calibration，以 characterization\n      为叙事主线、calibration 为方法验证。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"S1-only 贯穿所有 scale，γ 仅在 ARC 显著——D038 pivot 成为主 framing，calibration 降为 proof-of-concept\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"S2/S4 在 1.5B/3B 仍 AUC<0.55，RRF 退化为 S1-dominant 模式\"\n      - \"γ 仅在 ARC 显著（forgetting 方向），GSM8K 用真实信号不显著，MMLU 拟合勉强收敛但 γ 不显著\"\n      - \"Coverage 在 N=16 下仅恢复到 40-60%，仍远低于 nominal\"\n      - \"MAE 在 ARC 优于 raw，在 GSM8K/MMLU 不优于 raw\"\n      - \"exp-004 sim sweep 确认 N<30 下 coverage 结构性不足\"\n    number_ranges:\n      gamma_significance_rate: [0.15, 0.40]  # 仅 ARC（可能+oracle GSM8K）\n      mae_vs_raw_delta: [-0.01, 0.05]  # 整体 IRT 不优于 raw，ARC 例外\n      coverage_95: [0.40, 0.60]\n      s2_s4_auc_at_1p5B: [0.48, 0.58]  # 仍无效\n      rrf_vs_s1only_mae_gap: [-0.005, 0.005]  # 无差异\n      kendall_tau: [0.60, 0.78]\n      ppp_range: [0.0, 0.15]  # 或 [0.90, 1.0]，系统性 misspecification\n    narrative_direction: >\n      论文转为 D038 framing：\"systematic diagnostic framework revealing benchmark-dependent\n      contamination behavior\"。三个 co-equal 贡献重排序：(1) signal effectiveness\n      characterization（S1 唯一有效 + Min-K++ 反转 + scale-dependent failure 降级为\n      method-specific failure）；(2) Fisher Info 可辨识分析（理论贡献，不依赖实验结果）；\n      (3) ContamCal 作为 proof-of-concept 展示 IRT+γ 能捕获 benchmark-dependent 效应\n      （ARC forgetting vs GSM8K null），但 calibration accuracy 不 claim improvement。\n      Coverage gap 作为 honest limitation 讨论（N 不足 + local independence violation）。\n      Claim 1 从 \"recovers true performance\" 改为 \"reveals contamination effect direction\n      and magnitude\"。RRF 价值论述从 aggregation 转为 \"principled design choice for\n      future multi-signal regime\"。仍冲 EMNLP，靠 empirical findings 的 novelty 和\n      characterization 的系统性。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"IRT 校准全面失败、信号单一、coverage 崩塌——需完全 reframe 为负面结果 + 信号诊断学贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"MMLU IRT 拟合始终不收敛（rhat>1.1），无法报告 MMLU 结果\"\n      - \"γ 仅在 oracle 条件下显著，所有真实信号条件下 CI 均包含 0\"\n      - \"Coverage 停留在 20-33%，即使 N=16 也无改善\"\n      - \"S1 在 1.5B/3B 的 d005 检测也出现退化（AUC<0.90）\"\n      - \"exp-004 sim sweep 揭示 N<50 + AUC<0.80 下 γ 结构性不可辨识\"\n      - \"3B 也出现 MMLU 类似的拟合问题，非 0.5B 特有\"\n    number_ranges:\n      gamma_significance_rate: [0.0, 0.10]  # 仅 oracle ARC 显著\n      mae_vs_raw_delta: [0.03, 0.10]  # IRT 全面劣于 raw\n      coverage_95: [0.18, 0.35]\n      s2_s4_auc_at_1p5B: [0.45, 0.55]  # 随机水平\n      rrf_vs_s1only_mae_gap: [0.0, 0.02]  # RRF 反而更差\n      kendall_tau: [0.40, 0.60]\n      ppp_range: [0.0, 0.05]  # 或 [0.95, 1.0]，极端 misspecification\n    narrative_direction: >\n      论文彻底放弃 calibration claim，reframe 为三部分：(1) \"Why contamination calibration\n      is harder than it looks\"——负面结果贡献，系统性展示 IRT+γ 在 LLM 评估中失败的\n      结构性原因（N 不足、local independence 违反、信号质量不够），这本身是对社区的\n      warning（类比 Emperor's New Clothes 对 mitigation 的否定）；(2) signal failure\n      mode characterization——Min-K++ 方向性反转（Cohen's d=-1.98）是最可引用的发现，\n      加上 S1 作为唯一可靠信号的实证、d100 标签退化的解释；(3) benchmark-dependent\n      contamination effects——ARC 灾难性遗忘 vs GSM8K 天然抗性 vs MMLU 微弱效应，\n      作为 empirical finding 独立于方法是否 work。Fisher Info 分析仍保留，reframe 为\n      \"identifiability impossibility result\"——证明在现有信号质量和模型数量下，γ 精确\n      估计在理论上就不可行。仍投 EMNLP：venue 特别主题明确欢迎 negative results 和\n      contamination governance 工作，\"20 mitigation strategies fail + calibration also\n      fails\" 是更强的 community message。标题方向：\"The Limits of Post-Hoc Contamination\n      Calibration: An IRT-Based Diagnostic Study\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27385,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27385},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da9980c1-fa70-4c9b-bf09-5c9f4ae1a081","uuid":"fbfa0223-385a-4f91-95dc-b7b24bbd5b22"}
